<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Accent Color started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Accent Color started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Cowen &amp; Co said it started coverage of Accent Color Sciences Inc with a strong buy rating on Monday.</p>
<p>-- The investment bank was the lead underwriter of the company's December initial public offering. It went public at $9 a share.</p>
<p>-- Shares fell over 20 percent, losing 2-1/2 to 9-5/8.</p>
<p>-- No further details were immediately available.</p>
</text>
